<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE - Foreign trade, wholesale sales.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE - Foreign trade, wholesale sales.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR	PERIOD	 PREVIOUS		 EXPECTED</p>
<p>					    DATA		     DATE</p>
<p> Trade balance     Feb	  +5.6 bln DM	     Apr 29</p>
<p> Wholesale sales   March  +0.1 pct m/m, +0.6 y/y    May 2 or 5</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the expected release dates were targets. The previous data show month-on-month change, followed by year-on-year change.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
